    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Measure the temporal and geographic sequence of last occurrences for species and higher taxa, and quantify clustering at extinction horizons. Compare range contraction and staggered losses with globally synchronous abrupt disappearance.";
